Package: socratr
Type: Package
Title: Fast R Interface to Socrata Open Data Portals
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-09-16
Authors@R: person("Derek Schaadt", email = "dschaadt@alum.mit.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read, write, and list datasets on Socrata open data portals
    <https://dev.socrata.com>. Supports SODA 3 JSON and SODA 2 CSV downloads
    with automatic pagination, optional schema-based type coercion, parallel
    fetching and uploading for large datasets, and Discovery API listing.
    Inspired by the RSocrata package
    <https://github.com/Chicago/RSocrata> by the City of Chicago.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/dschaadt32/socratr
BugReports: https://github.com/dschaadt32/socratr/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    yyjsonr,
    data.table,
    lubridate (>= 1.7.0),
    janitor,
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    roxygen2 (>= 7.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    patchwork,
    scales,
    withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
